  "limitations": [
    "The legacy setup PNG was omitted by the upload glob: legacy-member-setup-private-memory.png did not match legacy-member-memory-*.png. The source-only fix renames the output to legacy-member-memory-setup-private.png; that new capture remains pending the next CI run.",
    "member-memory-recall-before.png captures the search loading skeleton, not a settled browse result. Returned recall evidence is shown in member-memory-recall-evidence.png.",
    "Desktop empty states and list views end at the viewport boundary; their lower copy or subsequent records are not fully represented. Bulk-selection framing also crops the upper identity header.",
    "Video review sampled all ten recordings at 1 fps into 83 frames. All ten contact sheets were viewed. Subsecond transitions and every intermediate action were not watched continuously; scenario outcomes come from the CI receipts and assertions.",
    "Mobile recording frames occupy part of the original desktop video canvas after a viewport resize. The resulting blank padding is a recording artifact, not inferred application overflow.",
    "The gallery captures show the Design Critique detail page in English at desktop and mobile sizes. They do not visually certify all seventeen compacted app descriptions or all locales.",
    "The dashboard and gateway are real with synthetic data in an isolated install. The browser fixture uses a fake ACP provider. Backup staging/cancellation and experience restoration do not establish deployed gateway restart activation or a live provider fleet.",
